    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/a08fa7d0e123d5c34cc28f3a4aa8b057.avif?t=1729510990\" /></div><br><br>Potion Tales is a narrative-driven Potion Brewing game in which you brew magical potions for your customers to solve their unique problems. <br><br>Each customer has unique needs and requests, and it's up to you to choose a fitting potion using your brewing skills and ingredients at hand.<br><br>But be warned - every decision you make will significantly impact the outcome, and your customers' fate is in your hands!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Meet your customers</strong></h2><br>\u2022 Listen to the unique problems and stories of various inhabitants in a colorful fantasy world.<br><br>\u2022Meet intriguing characters such as grave tender with plans to fill vacant graves, a fire spirit training to become a water mage and a man striving to become a god.<br><br>\u2022 Use your brewing skills to make potions that will determine the fate of these characters and their stories.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/1ebdb415c9613fff9dd7bb5c4da6d9a2.poster.avif?t=1729510990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/1ebdb415c9613fff9dd7bb5c4da6d9a2.webm?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/1ebdb415c9613fff9dd7bb5c4da6d9a2.mp4?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Brew a variety of magical potions</strong></h2><br>\u2022 Use almost 30 different ingredients at your disposal to brew 20 unique potions.<br><br>\u2022 Discover potions recipes and an ingredients index in your trusty potion book. <br><br>\u2022 Carefully follow recipes and prepare your ingredients by cutting, crushing, or liquefying them.<br><br>\u2022 Ensure each ingredient is added to the cauldron in the correct order to brew the perfect potion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.poster.avif?t=1729510990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.webm?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.mp4?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make yourself at home</strong></h2><br>\u2022 Enjoy a colourful, Low-poly Art-Syle<br><br>\u2022 Arrange your workspace to your liking<br><br>\u2022 Immerse yourself in the atmospheric sounds of the potion kitchen while listening to a cozy soundtrack<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.poster.avif?t=1729510990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.webm?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.mp4?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
