ollow recipes and prepare your ingredients by cutting, crushing, or liquefying them.<br><br>\u2022 Ensure each ingredient is added to the cauldron in the correct order to brew the perfect potion.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.poster.avif?t=1729510990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.webm?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/bbf72a836ec52aa2698fc901b4e1d328.mp4?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make yourself at home</strong></h2><br>\u2022 Enjoy a colourful, Low-poly Art-Syle<br><br>\u2022 Arrange your workspace to your liking<br><br>\u2022 Immerse yourself in the atmospheric sounds of the potion kitchen while listening to a cozy soundtrack<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.poster.avif?t=1729510990\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.webm?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094540/extras/e4bcf78742ae4b4aa8b0cc9e154c5561.mp4?t=1729510990\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
